+    // Quickshell build PamContext.abort() emits neither completed nor error, so the path was not
+    // reachable when it was probed (2026-11-10); abort's behaviour is an implementation detail, and
+    // runBlank sets screenBlanked before it stops the round, so this stays cheap and correct.
+    if (!lockRequested || !fingerprintConfigured || fingerprintPaused || screenBlanked) return
